@host = http://localhost:8081

### B1 - pet owners by last name (expected 200, David then Mario)
GET {{host}}/api/pet-owners/by-last-name?lastName=ndjimbo

### B1 - upper case gives the same result (IgnoreCase)
GET {{host}}/api/pet-owners/by-last-name?lastName=NDJIMBO

### B1 - nobody matches (expected 200, empty list)
GET {{host}}/api/pet-owners/by-last-name?lastName=zzz

### B2 - BOOKED (expected 200, 4 sessions, earliest first)
GET {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/by-status?status=BOOKED

### B2 - FINISHED (expected 200, 3 sessions)
GET {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/by-status?status=FINISHED

### B2 - invalid status (expected 400)
GET {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/by-status?status=XYZ

### B3 - October (expected 200, 6 sessions ordered by date)
GET {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/between?start=2026-10-01&end=2026-10-31

### B3 - single day, both ends inclusive (expected 200, 2 sessions)
GET {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/between?start=2026-10-20&end=2026-10-20

### B3 - November (expected 200, 4 sessions)
GET {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/between?start=2026-11-01&end=2026-11-30

### B3 - no sessions (expected 200, empty list)
GET {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/between?start=2027-01-01&end=2027-01-31